KVIrc is a free and portable IRC client leveraging the Qt GUI toolkit.
KVIrc is written by Szymon Stefanek and the KVIrc development team,
with contributions and support of many IRC addicted developers around
the world.

Flavors:
	dcc_voice	- build with voice messaging over DCC
	kde		- build with KDE integration
	python		- build with python scripting support
	qtwebengine	- build with webpage loading support
	spellchecker	- build with spellchecking support using textproc/enchant
